{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++", "description": "This file implements the ProtobufIRDiffDumper class which provides functionality for dumping IR diff data into protobuf format. It includes methods for adding various types of IR diff messages, ELF symbols, functions, and global variables, as well as computing compatibility status. The file is part of a header checker tool for protobuf IR diffs, related to code comparison and analysis, and contains various includes from protobuf and LLVM support libraries.", "external_files": ["repr/protobuf/ir_diff_representation.h", "repr/protobuf/api.h", "repr/protobuf/converter.h", "llvm/Support/raw_ostream.h", "google/protobuf/io/zero_copy_stream_impl.h", "google/protobuf/text_format.h"], "external_methods": ["IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertElfFunctionIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertElfObjectIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertRecordTypeIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertFunctionIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertEnumTypeIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertGlobalVarIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertRecordTypeDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertFunctionDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertEnumTypeDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertGlobalVarDiffIR", "CompatibilityStatusIRToProtobuf"], "published": ["ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "CreateProtobufIRDiffDumper"], "classes": [{"name": "ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "description": "A class that serializes IR difference data into protobuf format, providing methods for adding detailed diff information, ELF symbols, and obtaining compatibility status."}], "methods": [{"name": "void AddLibNameIR(const std::string & name)", "description": "Sets the library name in the diff protobuf.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "void AddArchIR(const std::string & arch)", "description": "Sets the architecture name in the diff protobuf.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name"